WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.867
For the assessment, you will build a cleaned customer output while leaving the source table unchanged.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:13.002
The starter query gives you the original customer fields inside a common table expression.

00:00:13.002 --> 00:00:16.142
Your task is to extend that query.

00:00:16.142 --> 00:00:20.807
Create a cleaned name by handling spacing and display case.

00:00:20.807 --> 00:00:25.817
Create a cleaned email by trimming and standardizing the text.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:29.974
Create a cleaned phone candidate using the rules from this module.

00:00:30.543 --> 00:00:34.460
Then add a row-level quality status and a duplicate rank.

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:38.240
As you work, think about the order of operations.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:45.435
Normalize before you validate. Detect possible duplicates before making any resolution decision.

00:00:45.435 --> 00:00:49.230
Preserve uncertainty instead of inventing replacements.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:52.385
Do not focus only on making the query run.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:56.086
Make sure you can explain why each transformation is appropriate.
